    "step": {
      "init": {
        "title": "Options",
        "description": "Estimation needs nominal voltage and capacity. The cloud coordinate reference is unverified. Enable controls and select allowed vehicles to send bell, seat-trunk, start and stop commands. Ninebot decides permission and vehicle support. Known denials, authentication failures or stale data prevent sending; failed commands are not retried automatically. Control status means ready to send, not that the vehicle completed an action. Configured buttons appear automatically; user-disabled buttons remain disabled.",
